1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,800
Searching for Grand Bahia Principe Punta Cana? It has a new name: Bahia Principe Explore Punta Cana.

2
00:00:06,850 --> 00:00:12,640
It belongs to the Hyatt Inclusive Collection, and Expedia lists it as renovated twenty twenty-six.

3
00:00:12,691 --> 00:00:18,107
You get one thousand four hundred twenty-eight rooms with balconies, right next to a white-sand beach.

4
00:00:18,157 --> 00:00:23,090
Five lake-style pools spread through the gardens, with a waterslide and two swim-up bars.

5
00:00:23,140 --> 00:00:27,127
The water park is free, and so are breakfast, Wi-Fi, and parking.

6
00:00:27,177 --> 00:00:30,728
Add seven restaurants, a spa, a gym, and a nightclub.

7
00:00:30,778 --> 00:00:34,828
Watch the full tour on my channel.
